{% summary %}
The current refresh flow allows multiple concurrent requests to exchange the same refresh token, potentially causing redundant work and inconsistent session replacement.
{% /summary %}

## Context

Session refresh is triggered independently by each request.

The relevant code lives in {% file path="examples/fixtures/auth/session.ts" lines="9-15" /%}.

{% media path="examples/artifacts/refresh-flow.svg" alt="Two requests entering one refresh flow concurrently" caption="Observed concurrent refresh flow" /%}

